; case: invalid-unknown-unit
; expect: invalid-description
; why: A task period whose unit the table does not hold. F03's other half: an incompatible
;   unit is a type error, and it is one at the schema rather than at the arithmetic that
;   would have converted it.
;
(eadl-version eadl/1)

(defsystem s (task t (period 10 parsec) (deadline 10 ms) (priority 1)))
